title: Payload served as an image
severity: medium
score: 30
tags: cache-smuggling
attack: T1027.006, T1036
description: A response served as an image is really an archive or executable (ZIP, RAR, 7z,
  PE, CAB, OLE). Real CDNs that mislabel content serve another image type, not this.
